    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "cmcCatBowl",
        "LocalizationKey": "CMC_CatBowl_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A clay bowl set down for the cats. Put raw or cooked meat or fish in it, and a hungry tamed cat on the same board will eat from it on its own. Every self-served meal chips away at that cat's Care."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "cmcCatBowl",
        "LocalizationKey": "CMC_CatBowl_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Self-serve:</b> When Ash or Shadow is hungry and the bowl holds meat or fish, the cat eats one piece, its Hunger is restored and its Care drops, the same bargain as the Rain Cistern.\n<b>Take Apart:</b> Gives back the Clay Bowl; anything left inside is spilled."
    },
